{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787610/extras/23ba0affc80a4d99dee3c31676c5d0ec.avif?t=1748621796\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Relencost is a world ravaged by ancient conflict. The surface has been rendered unlivable by a permanent chaotic magical storm. <br>The survivors in this post apocalyptic world have ascended above the cloud layer, finding safety upon the tallest mountain peaks and the floating islands scattered around the world. <br><br>One place remains treacherous above all others: <strong>The Stormwall. </strong><br><br>A place so dangerous that it's shifting depths are rarely explored and only the bravest or most greedy dare to travel. <br><br>Each day, a new safe passage will shift into being, opening or closing the path to different locations. <br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787610/extras/c7c481a65c185380e2bc39e3c5c7b775.avif?t=1748621796\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>You and your colleagues will delve into the depths of The Stormwall, locating and retrieving lost treasures from  Pre-War Relencost while completing contracts from the Ranadeen Empire.<br>You'll use numerous tools and gadgets to increase your odds of survival, and more importantly: Loot. You will use your hard earned wealth to upgrade your ship allowing you to move deeper into the storm for greater rewards and precious Skystones.<br><br>*Sail over chasms with the Glider<br><br>*Reach untold heights with the Grapple pack<br><br>*Use your hard earned gold to purchase new and more powerful tools in the supply outpost. <br><br>*Unlock permanent character upgrades with Skystones given as rewards for completing the Ranadeen salvage contracts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787610/extras/dab5902bcb9576b57404b61e9a7f5869.poster.avif?t=1748621796\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787610/extras/dab5902bcb9576b57404b61e9a7f5869.webm?t=1748621796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787610/extras/dab5902bcb9576b57404b61e9a7f5869.mp4?t=1748621796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787610/extras/4373c6a33943bf09a40acc4bb12ba063.avif?t=1748621796\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Gather your fellow Stormtreaders and work together to survive The Stormwall. <br>Ancient locations are filled with terrible enemies intent on making each trip your last. <br>Keep your eyes peeled and your wits sharp to get your loot back to the ship.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787610/extras/ef6f5da587e965ada85c44152b4a54bf.avif?t=1748621796\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Move quickly as activity inside of the storm wall attracts the unwanted attention of Mighty Goliath's called Stormbeasts. <br>Few things can survive a direct conflict with a stormbeast, so make sure that you, your ship, and your goods have left before they show up.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787610/extras/4b5f1ec63463a3dffde6433b85ca1cf2.avif?t=1748621796\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>**Features**<br><br>*Procedurally Generated Maps, Dungeons, and Events for infinite replayability<br><br>*Permanent Character progression<br><br>*Proximity Voice Chat<br><br>*Co-Op Multiplayer<br><br>*Dozens of Unique Pieces of Equipment<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img cla